# Bentley Continental GT coupe, first generation, 2003-2011.
#
# The Continental GT that revived Bentley's volume: 4,808 mm long, 1,918 mm wide,
# 1,391 mm high, 2,746 mm wheelbase; 6.0 W12 twin-turbo, four-wheel drive.
# About 5,100 first-generation cars licensed in the UK in 2019.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bentley_Continental_GT
#
# Colours: Beluga Black, Silver Tempest, Neptune Blue and Verdant Green are period
# Bentley finishes.
#
# Weight: 25 in total (black 8, silver 7, blue 5, green 5).
#
# Speed 300 km/h; comfort 150/555 (line).
# Dates: 2003-2011 with a road tail to about 2020.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/bentley-continental-gt.blend. References:
# citycars/references/bentley-continental-gt/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia
# Commons.

